---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<Header />
<main class="container article">
  <p class="mono eyebrow">about me</p>
  <h1>George Choulakis</h1>
  <p class="lead">I work at the intersection of data, automation, and business processes.</p>

  <div class="image-placeholder">Large personal photo or doodle scene</div>

  <h2>What I like building</h2>
  <p>
    Most of my work starts with something messy: an Excel process that takes too long, data living in several systems,
    reports that nobody fully trusts, or a workflow that depends too much on manual effort.
  </p>
  <p>
    I like turning those problems into reliable systems using SQL, Power BI, Python, automation, and a lot of curiosity.
  </p>

  <h2>Beyond the screen</h2>
  <p>
    Music has always been a big part of my life. I also have a soft spot for cats, Playmobil figures, white wired headphones,
    and rubber-duck debugging.
  </p>
</main>
<Footer />

<style>
.article { max-width:820px; padding-top:70px; }
.eyebrow { color:#4b6b88; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; font-size:.82rem; }
h1 { font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6rem); letter-spacing:-.05em; margin:.2rem 0 1rem; }
.lead { font-size:1.25rem; color:var(--muted); }
.image-placeholder { height:360px; margin:42px 0; border:2px solid #111; border-radius:28px; background:var(--blue-soft); display:grid; place-items:center; color:#56748f; font-weight:700; }
h2 { margin-top:42px; font-size:2rem; }
p { font-size:1.06rem; }
</style>
